{"id":"leiden","name":"莱顿","en":"Leiden","country":"Netherlands","lat":52.16,"lng":4.49,"dek":"运河、书页与围城记忆交织的大学城","history":"莱顿建在一座人造山丘上，旧莱茵河与新莱茵河在此交汇。约860年的文献里，这里被称作Leithon。山丘上的据点最初受乌得勒支主教支配，到12世纪前后转归荷兰伯国。1266年，莱顿获得城市权。\n\n16世纪，纺织业让莱顿繁荣起来，宽幅细毛织品远销各地。1572年，城市站到反抗西班牙的一方。1574年5月至10月，莱顿被西班牙军队围困，城中断粮；人们破坏堤防，让船只把粮食送进四面是水的城里，围困才得以解除。据传市民当时可以选择建立一所大学或豁免某些税收，他们选择了大学。1575年，威廉一世建立莱顿大学。\n\n17世纪是莱顿的黄金时代，来自弗兰德的难民推动纺织工业，印刷与出版业也随之兴盛，埃尔泽维尔家族的印厂延续数代。此后布业衰落，城市逐渐沉寂。今日的莱顿仍是大学城，莱顿大学与莱顿大学医学中心构成城市的日常节奏。","culture":"莱顿的文化气质与大学分不开。1575年建立的莱顿大学让这座城在围困之后重新站稳，也使印刷、出版和学术在这里积累下层层痕迹。埃尔泽维尔的名字从16世纪的印厂延续至今，成为学术出版的一个符号。\n\n城市里散布着多处博物馆：国立古物博物馆、国立民族学博物馆、布尔哈夫博物馆、莱顿植物园，以及记录印刷与纺织历史的场所。每年10月3日，莱顿庆祝解围，纪念1574年那段被围困又被水与船解救的日子。","pull":"市民在围城后选了一所大学，而不是免税。","sights":[{"name":"莱顿城堡","orig":"Burcht van Leiden","intro":"城中心一座人造山丘上的旧据点，莱顿最早的名字就与这里有关。山顶如今是开放的圆形平台，可以俯瞰旧莱茵河与城内屋顶。山丘不高，却是理解这座城起源的起点。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f5/De_burcht_leiden_2003.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":655},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burcht_van_Leiden"},{"name":"莱顿大学","orig":"Universiteit Leiden","intro":"1575年由威廉一世建立，是荷兰最古老的大学之一。校园散布在城中心，旧建筑与运河相邻。走在城里，常能遇到骑自行车的学生，大学的节奏渗进街道与咖啡馆。","img":null,"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%90%8A%E9%A0%93%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%B8"},{"name":"国立古物博物馆","orig":"Rijksmuseum van Oudheden","intro":"荷兰的国家考古博物馆，收藏涵盖古埃及、古希腊罗马与近东。馆内有埃及神庙建筑构件与木乃伊，也有本地罗马时期的出土物。对莱顿周边的罗马定居点玛提洛，这里提供背景。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Rijksmuseum_van_Oudheden.jpg/960px-Rijksmuseum_van_Oudheden.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":631},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9B%BD%E7%AB%8B%E5%8F%A4%E7%89%A9%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86"},{"name":"国立民族学博物馆","orig":"Museum Volkenkunde","intro":"位于莱顿的国立民族学博物馆，收藏来自世界各地的民族志物品。展览关注不同文化的生活与信仰，常设与特展交替。建筑临运河，参观完可沿河走回城中心。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Museum_Volkenkunde_%28National_Museum_of_Ethnology%29_in_Leiden_1.jpg/960px-Museum_Volkenkunde_%28National_Museum_of_Ethnology%29_in_Leiden_1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":613},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9B%BD%E7%AB%8B%E6%B0%91%E6%97%8F%E5%AD%A6%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86_(%E8%8D%B7%E5%85%B0)"},{"name":"德·法尔克风车博物馆","orig":"Molen De Valk","intro":"一座仍在城内的旧风车，如今作为市立风车博物馆开放。沿窄梯向上，可以看到磨坊的机械与石磨，顶层视野开阔，能望见莱顿的屋顶与河道。风车是这座城轮廓的一部分。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Leiden%2C_zicht_vanaf_Blauwpoortsbrug_naar_Beestenmarkt%2C_Rederij_Rembrandt_en_Molen_de_Valk_RM25655_foto7_2017-06-11_10.18.jpg/960px-Leiden%2C_zicht_vanaf_Blauwpoortsbrug_naar_Beestenmarkt%2C_Rederij_Rembrandt_en_Molen_de_Valk_RM25655_foto7_2017-06-11_10.18.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":538},"src":null}],"foods":[{"name":"莱顿奶酪","orig":"Leidse kaas","intro":"一种带孜然籽的荷兰奶酪，质地偏硬，切面常见香料颗粒。常夹在面包里，或切成小块配饮品。莱顿及周边奶酪铺可以买到。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Leyden_cheese_AvL.jpg/960px-Leyden_cheese_AvL.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":636},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%90%8A%E9%A0%93%E8%8A%9D%E5%A3%AB"},{"name":"荷兰松饼","orig":"Stroopwafel","intro":"两片薄烤饼夹入糖浆，通常放在热饮杯口稍作加热，让糖浆变软。莱顿的集市与糕饼摊有售，适合边走边吃。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Stroopwafels_01.jpg/960px-Stroopwafels_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":960},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stroopwafel"},{"name":"鲱鱼","orig":"Haring","intro":"荷兰常见的生腌鲱鱼，处理后可整条入口，也可夹在面包里，配洋葱碎。莱顿的鱼摊与集市上能买到，是本地人日常的小吃。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Global_capture_of_all_herring_1950%E2%80%932010.png/960px-Global_capture_of_all_herring_1950%E2%80%932010.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":518},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%AF%A1%E9%AD%9A"},{"name":"荷兰小松饼","orig":"Poffertjes","intro":"小圆饼状的发酵面糊点心，煎好后撒糖粉与黄油，口感松软。莱顿的集市摊或点心店常见，趁热吃最好。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Poffertjes-Melkhuis_%28cropped%29.jpg/960px-Poffertjes-Melkhuis_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":611},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8D%B7%E8%98%AD%E5%B0%8F%E9%AC%86%E9%A4%85"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Leiden%2C_Netherlands_-_panoramio_%2825%29.jpg/1280px-Leiden%2C_Netherlands_-_panoramio_%2825%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":859},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Leiden%2C_Netherlands_-_panoramio_%2836%29.jpg/1280px-Leiden%2C_Netherlands_-_panoramio_%2836%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":859}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[4.4388652,52.1532645],[4.4439394,52.1460413],[4.4429886,52.1453458],[4.4437895,52.1410133],[4.4446782,52.1406199],[4.4496051,52.1409843],[4.4592873,52.1496967],[4.4654056,52.1494429],[4.4671714,52.1369432],[4.4692987,52.1339305],[4.4684551,52.1317393],[4.4644924,52.1273112],[4.465192,52.1266134],[4.4664203,52.1273334],[4.4666324,52.1288655],[4.4681493,52.1285508],[4.4729415,52.1237032],[4.4722891,52.1196346],[4.4729755,52.1189516],[4.48752,52.1274097],[4.5132128,52.1399741],[4.5106766,52.1408659],[4.5155451,52.1444636],[4.5240721,52.1474052],[4.5208208,52.156551],[4.5146993,52.1610171],[4.5161945,52.1658173],[4.5150808,52.1710159],[4.518488,52.174216],[4.5177407,52.1759413],[4.5183538,52.1824918],[4.5038811,52.1846058],[4.4975622,52.1839827],[4.4961655,52.1788913],[4.4923823,52.1753429],[4.4878399,52.1781537],[4.4871261,52.1769253],[4.4807958,52.1796281],[4.479708,52.1790039],[4.4786016,52.1795869],[4.4716849,52.1745027],[4.4685092,52.173482],[4.4672343,52.1721705],[4.4675732,52.1704512],[4.466868,52.1699286],[4.4541706,52.1711405],[4.4530522,52.1684921],[4.4500793,52.1658393],[4.4490006,52.1626784],[4.4392325,52.1547075],[4.4388652,52.1532645]]]},"credit":{"model":"deepseek-flash","wiki":{"zh":"莱顿","en":"Leiden","voyage":null}}}